# Sakrylle Theme & UI

## Brand

- Name: "Sakrylle 图像工坊"
- Primary: Monet `#9181bd` (`--primary: 253 26% 62%`)
- Logo: `src/components/icons.tsx::SakrylleLogo` — do not reintroduce `public/pwa-icon.svg`
- `body` must keep `sakrylle-ambient` class (`index.html`)

## Colors — no blue-*

All Tailwind `blue-*` swept to Monet purple hex: `#f1edf8` / `#c4b8e0` / `#9181bd` / `#7d6cb0` / `#6e5fa6` / `#5b4d8e`. On upstream rebase, replace any new `blue-*` immediately.

## Liquid Glass

Use utilities from `src/index.css` `@layer utilities`: `.glass-panel`, `.glass-card`, `.glass-input-shell`, `.glass-button`, `.glass-button-primary`. Do not invent new `bg-white/X backdrop-blur` combos.

## Theme switch

`src/lib/theme.ts` — View Transition API circle reveal; `prefers-reduced-motion` → instant. Key: `sakrylle-image-playground.theme`.

## FOUC prevention (do not break)

`index.html` `<head>` inline IIFE **before** `<link>` tags: sync apply `dark` class + `<html lang>` from localStorage. Wrap storage/matchMedia in try/catch.

## Removed features (keep removed)

- PWA install prompt / `beforeinstallprompt`
- `HelpModal.tsx` — deleted; rebase conflicts → keep deleted

## Header behavior

Balance poll every 60s when `document.visibilityState === 'visible'`; refresh on tab visible. Recharge → `https://sub.sakrylle.com/purchase`. About page must keep CookSleep upstream link + MIT license.
